repository-code: 'https://github.com/sambhajithakar/palbociclib-resistance-isg'
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, result tables and figures for an integrative study of
  palbociclib resistance in oestrogen receptor-positive breast cancer models.
  Three independent resistant model systems are integrated by robust rank
  aggregation, characterised by enrichment and network analysis, and used to
  build a machine-learning signature that is assessed under both conventional
  and fully nested leave-one-dataset-out validation. The derived risk score is
  tested in TCGA-BRCA, METABRIC and the FELINE trial, and approved drugs are
  docked against a validated subsite of the STAT1 SH2 domain.
keywords:
